### Dashboard protegido
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar eventos
GET {{baseUrl}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar evento - somente admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mutirão de recuperação ambiental",
  "description": "Ação de limpeza e plantio em área comunitária.",
  "event_date": "2026-12-12",
  "location": "Parque Municipal",
  "max_volunteers": 30,
  "status": "active"
}

### Consultar evento
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alterar evento - somente admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active",
  "max_volunteers": 45
}

### Listar voluntários
GET {{baseUrl}}/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar voluntário - somente admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diego Oliveira",
  "email": "diego.oliveira@example.com",
  "phone": "(51) 99999-4444",
  "password": "123456",
  "status": "active"
}

### Inscrever voluntário em evento - respeita capacidade máxima
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/1/volunteers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Voluntário autenticado se inscreve no evento
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/1/register
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}

### Voluntário autenticado cancela a própria inscrição
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/1/register
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}

### Listar inscritos no evento
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/1/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remover inscrição
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/1/volunteers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir voluntário - somente admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/volunteers/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

